[DRAFT] Answer:
```javascript
function generate_receive_log(msg) {
    const date = new Date();
    const isoString = date.toISOString();
    const timestamp = isoString.slice(0, 19);
    return `[${timestamp}] Received: ${msg}`;
}
```
